# The four slices of the console stylesheet. Their bytes *are* the stylesheet:
# `security_headers` hashes the joined string for `style-src`, and the goal is
# that one commit produces one sheet on every machine. `core.autocrlf=true`
# would otherwise rewrite their line endings on checkout, because those endings
# are inside string literals and git makes no distinction.
src/web/assets/style/*.rs text eol=lf
